Reject a program config element without a front element.

The decoder takes its channel configuration from the first front element
of a program_config_element(). With none, ele_is_cpe[0] kept a stale
scratch value, set_mc_info() derived the channel count from it (12 with
the fuzzer's input) and the frame loop indexed past pChVars[2] (heap
overflow). get_prog_config.cpp now rejects the element.

Regression input:
tools/aacdec-fuzz/regressions/t169-pce-without-front.bin.

